---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/tests/options.rs
expression: "sections.join(\"\\n\")"
---
## schema publish format
cli -h: --format <FORMAT> Export format the published schema describes [default: graph] [possible values: graph, context, brief]
default: cli=graph = json
graph                        cli=0   mcp=-
context                      cli=0   mcp=-
brief                        cli=0   mcp=-
dot                          cli=2   mcp=-
json                         cli=0   mcp=-

## analyze pass
cli -h: [PASS] Analysis pass to run: all (default), coverage, contracts, or a pass an extension declares (`<extension>:<pass>`)
mcp schema: enum null default "all"
default: cli=all mcp=all
all                          cli=0   mcp=ok
coverage                     cli=0   mcp=ok
contracts                    cli=0   mcp=ok
@specforge/testing:coverage  cli=0   mcp=ok
nosuch                       cli=2   mcp=refused: invalid_input: Unknown analysis pass 'nosuch' (available: all, coverage, contracts, @specforge/testing:coverage)
